---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="ProofDesk — Order Received" description="Your ProofDesk order is confirmed. Here's what happens next.">

<section style="padding-top: 180px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5vw;">

    <div class="eyebrow">AnchorForge ProofDesk</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.1;">We're on it.</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      Your ProofDesk order is confirmed. Rhet has been notified by text and email.
      Here's what happens next.
    </p>

    <!-- NEXT STEPS -->
    <div class="ps-steps">
      <div class="ps-step">
        <div class="ps-num">1</div>
        <div class="ps-content">
          <h3>Send your evidence folder</h3>
          <p>Email everything to <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com?subject=ProofDesk%20Evidence%20Folder" style="color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600;">reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com</a> with subject line <strong>"ProofDesk Evidence Folder"</strong>.</p>
          <p>Zip it if you can. If it's too big for email, we'll send you a secure upload link.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ps-step">
        <div class="ps-num">2</div>
        <div class="ps-content">
          <h3>We confirm receipt</h3>
          <p>You'll hear back within <strong>2 hours</strong> during business hours. Emergency Weekend Desk: within <strong>1 hour</strong>, any time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ps-step">
        <div class="ps-num">3</div>
        <div class="ps-content">
          <h3>We build your packet</h3>
          <p>Your evidence gets indexed, hashed, reviewed, and sealed. Every file cataloged, every claim mapped to its source, every gap named.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ps-step">
        <div class="ps-num">4</div>
        <div class="ps-content">
          <h3>You receive your sealed packet</h3>
          <p>Delivered via secure link. Includes manifest, checksums, chain of custody, claim review, risk register, handoff memo, source copy, and sealed zip. Printable binder available on request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TURNAROUND -->
    <div class="ps-turnaround">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top: 48px;">Turnaround times</div>
      <div class="ps-tier-grid">
        <div class="ps-tier"><strong>Starter Proof Seal</strong><span>3–5 business days</span></div>
        <div class="ps-tier"><strong>Founder Review Packet</strong><span>2–3 business days</span></div>
        <div class="ps-tier"><strong>Patent / AI Evidence Binder</strong><span>5–7 business days</span></div>
        <div class="ps-tier ps-tier-rush"><strong>Emergency Weekend Desk</strong><span>24 hours</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WHAT TO SEND -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">What to send us</div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 16px;">We accept chaos. That's the point.</h3>
      <div class="ps-accept-grid">
        <div class="ps-accept">Screenshots</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">PDFs & scans</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Code files & repos</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Notes & drafts</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Emails & threads</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Receipts & invoices</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">AI outputs & logs</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Provisional patent notes</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Photos of whiteboards</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Invention notebooks</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Contracts & agreements</div>
        <div class="ps-accept">Anything relevant</div>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 16px;">
        Don't organize it. Don't clean it up. Don't worry about what's important. That's our job.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- BOUNDARY -->
    <div class="ps-boundary" style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <p>
        <strong>Important:</strong> ProofDesk is proof operations, not legal advice.
        We do not file patents, represent you in court, or replace your attorney.
        We prepare the packet so the expensive person spends less time on intake and more time on your case.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTACT -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 80px; text-align: center;">
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Questions? Changes to your order? Need to send files?
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
        <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com" style="color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600;">reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 24px; font-style: italic;">
        Bring the folder. Leave with receipts.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ps-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ps-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ps-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ps-content h3 {
    color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ps-content p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ps-tier-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ps-tier {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .ps-tier strong { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); }
  .ps-tier span { color: var(--amber, #D4AF37); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; }

  .ps-tier-rush {
    border-color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.06);
  }

  .ps-accept-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ps-accept {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.08);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
  }

  .ps-boundary {
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.3);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.04);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .ps-boundary p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ps-boundary strong { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); }
</style>

</Layout>
